{%- comment -%}
  ELOURA - Shipping & Returns Policy Template
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="eloura-page-wrapper">
  <div class="container eloura-legal-container">
    <div class="eloura-page-header">
      <span class="eloura-page-eyebrow">CLIENT SERVICES</span>
      <h1 class="eloura-page-title">SHIPPING &amp; RETURNS</h1>
      <p class="eloura-page-subtitle">Last updated: {{ 'now' | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="eloura-article-content">
      <h2>1. DOMESTIC SHIPPING &amp; DELIVERY TIMELINE</h2>
      <p>All orders across Pakistan are processed and dispatched within 24 to 48 hours of order confirmation. Standard nationwide delivery takes <strong>2 to 4 business days</strong>.</p>

      <h2>2. FREE DELIVERY THRESHOLD</h2>
      <p>We are pleased to offer <strong>FREE EXPRESS DELIVERY</strong> on all orders totaling <strong>Rs. 10,000 or more</strong>. For orders below Rs. 10,000, standard nominal courier rates apply at checkout.</p>

      <h2>3. ORDER TRACKING</h2>
      <p>Once your order is handed over to our courier partner, you will receive an SMS and WhatsApp update with your tracking code so you can follow your shipment's journey in real time.</p>

      <h2>4. RETURN &amp; EXCHANGE POLICY</h2>
      <p>Please note that ELOURA operates under a <strong>strict No Return / No Exchange policy</strong> once an order is delivered in proper condition. Products cannot be returned or exchanged for change of mind or personal preference.</p>

      <h2>5. IN-TRANSIT DAMAGE &amp; STORE FAULT REPLACEMENTS</h2>
      <p>A return or replacement is <strong>only accepted</strong> if the item was damaged in transit during delivery or dispatched defective by our store team. In such cases:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You must notify our client support team within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong>.</li>
        <li>Provide clear photographic and/or unboxing video proof showing the package condition and damaged item.</li>
        <li>Once verified, we will arrange a replacement or resolve the issue free of charge immediately.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. HOW TO REPORT TRANSIT DAMAGE</h2>
      <p>To report a damaged parcel, please contact us immediately on WhatsApp at <strong>+92 325 5136747</strong> or email <strong>Eloura.pk1@gmail.com</strong> with your Order Number and photos/video.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

